    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the executive law, in relation to eliminating the requirement that certain minority and women-owned business enterprise owners have a personal net worth of less than three million five hundred thousand dollars in order to obtain certification as a qualifying minority and women-owned business enterprise; and clarifying that an individual's net worth is not to be considered in determining eligibility for certification under Article 15-A of the executive law",
